[I] Cross-platform DVD menu creation GUI

[T] DvdStyler is a cross-platform DVD menu creation GUI that allows
[T] the user to create DVD navigation menus similar to those found
[T] on most commercial DVDs.

[U] https://dvdstyler.sourceforge.net/

